WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.251 --> 00:00:01.250
- Welcome back, y'all.
(audience applauding)

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.747
We're here with the cast
of the new Netflix movie,

00:00:03.747 --> 00:00:04.580
"The Bubble",
(audience applauding)

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:09.240
Maria Bakalova, Iris
Apatow, Keegan Michael Key,

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.150
