director, Judd Apatow,

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.931
and Leslie Mann,
(all applauding)

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:16.840
my partner in crime.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.130
So "The Bubble" is the story

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.350
