Rubble with The Bubble".

00:00:30.451 --> 00:00:32.235
(Leslie laughs)
(upbeat music)

00:00:32.235 --> 00:00:34.963
♪ Double Trouble in the
Rubble with the Bubble ♪

00:00:34.963 --> 00:00:35.796
(audience applauds)

00:00:35.796 --> 00:00:36.640
So the teams are...

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.220
This is the winning one,
this is Leslie and me,

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.040
uh-huh, and then the others,
(Leslie chuckles)

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.870
Judd and Keegan Michael,
(all laughing)

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.450
and then Iris and Maria.

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:46.558
Good luck.

00:00:46.558 --> 00:00:47.391
(all laughing)

00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:50.610
We need a host, so, God are you there?

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:51.980
- [God] I am Kelly, how you doing girl?

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.120
- Okay, well, the world
might be coming to an end,

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.053
