00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:58.040
Hey, all you beautiful people,

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:00.029
and also Keegan.

00:01:00.029 --> 00:01:02.010
(all laughing)

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.120
I'm just playing Keegan, I'm just playing.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.310
So here's how the game works.

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:08.200
I'm gonna ask a trivia question
about a disaster movie,

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.030
