super fast zombies.

00:01:50.305 --> 00:01:51.138
(device ringing)

00:01:51.138 --> 00:01:51.971
- Oh, I got it. I got it.

00:01:51.971 --> 00:01:53.440
I got it.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.273
